\par\par \b \uc2 INDIA RUPEE-Rupee reacts little to fall in Asian peers on likely \uc2 RBI \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 303 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 August 2023\par 07:56\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2023 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 MUMBAI, Aug 21 (Reuters) - The Indian rupee was little changed on Monday despite a fall in Asian peers on likely \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The rupee was at 83.10 to the dollar by 11:22 a.m. IST, barely changed from Friday. The Chinese yuan, the Korean won and the Indonesian rupiah were all down 0.3%.\par \par \uc2 "Again, rupee is managing to avoid a fall to record low. \uc2 RBI\uc2 , at least for now, looks to want to keep rupee hovering around the 83 handle," a \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  trader said.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2  likely \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to keep the rupee in check in the face of an upbeat U.S. dollar.\par \par \uc2 "For the rupee, as long as the \uc2 RBI\uc2  defends 83.15, dollar bulls shall remain at bay," said Amit Pabari, managing director of \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  advisory firm CR \b \highlight22\uc2 Forex\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "In the short run, the pair is likely to remain caged in the 82.75-83.25 levels."\par \par \uc2 The offshore yuan dropped below 7.3250 to the dollar. China cut its one-year benchmark lending rate on Monday by 10 basis points, compared to a 15 bps reduction expected by majority of economists polled by Reuters.\par \par \uc2 Apart from the yuan and the \uc2 RBI\uc2 , rupee traders are looking at U.S. yields this week. The jump in long-maturity U.S. yields on expectations that the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2  will keep rates high for longer has impacted the demand for rupee and other emerging market \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 For cues on the path of U.S. interest rates, investors will watch Fed Chair \uc2 Jerome Powell\uc2 's comments this week at the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's Jackson Hole Economic Symposium. (Reporting by Nimesh Vora; Editing by Dhanya Ann Thoppil) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2023-8-21T06:56:14.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020230821ej8l00hft\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
