\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 INDIA \highlight\uc2  RUPEE-Indian rupee strengthens on dollar weakness, likely \uc2 RBI \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 303 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 August 2023\par 12:26\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2023 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 MUMBAI, Aug 10 (Reuters) - The Indian rupee strengthened against the U.S. dollar in the final minutes of trade on Thursday as the dollar weakened, and traders cited likely dollar sales by the \uc2 Reserve Bank of India\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The rupee closed at 82.7125, gaining 0.12% from the previous session.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 RBI\uc2  was possibly selling dollars in the final minutes of trade, two traders at state-run banks said. Foreign banks were also selling dollars following a correction in the dollar index , one of the traders said.\par \par \uc2 In its monetary policy decision on Thursday, the \uc2 Indian \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  kept rates unchanged but moved to reduce the amount of cash in banking system as inflation concerns resurfaced due to a spike in food prices.\par \par \uc2 Attention now shifts to U.S consumer inflation data , due at 6:00 p.m. IST (1230 GMT), which is expected to show that core prices rose by 0.2% in July for a yearly gain of 4.8%.\par \par \uc2 A softer-than-expected inflation reading could signal that the U.S. economy is cooling, while an inflation number above expectations could raise the possibility of another rate hike from the \uc2 U.S. Federal Reserve\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "Unless we get a completely out of the blue number, the rupee should not react much," said Abhilash Koikkrra, head of \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  & commodities at Nuvama Professional Clients Group said.\par \par \uc2 While the rupee has not depreciated below the 83 mark, that level might not hold for long, a \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  trader at a state-run bank said.\par \par \uc2 The expectation is that it will move to 83.20-25 levels over the next few weeks but not much beyond that, the trader said. (Reporting by Jaspreet Kalra; Editing by Varun H K) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2023-8-10T11:26:16.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020230810ej8a01jv6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
