\par\par \b \uc2 INDIA RUPEE-Rupee edges higher as dollar weakness, inflows offset importer demand\b0\par\par\uc2 281 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 Juli 2023\par 12:28\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2023 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 BENGALURU, July 27 (Reuters) - The Indian rupee ended slightly higher on Thursday after remaining rangebound through the day, as broad weakness in the greenback and corporate dollar inflows helped offset demand from importers.\par \par \uc2 The rupee ended at 81.93 against the dollar, compared to its close of 81.9950 on Wednesday.\par \par \uc2 There is consistent dollar inflows into equities and there is also demand from importers, including those purchasing oil, said Anil Bhansali, head treasury at Finrex Treasury Advisors.\par \par \uc2 Possible \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \uc2 Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2  was also limiting the rupee's appreciation as the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has bought dollars whenever the rupee moved above 81.90 zone, traders said.\par \par \uc2 On Wednesday the \uc2 U.S. Federal Reserve\uc2  raised interest rates by an expected 25 basis points, which many market participants see as the last despite chair \uc2 Jerome Powell\uc2  leaving the door open to another hike in September.\par \par \uc2 The dollar index was down 0.5% on Thursday.\par \par \uc2 "We see the broad USD index falling further into the end of the year. But the pace may be quite uneven until more conditions for a soft U.S. dollar are met," \uc2 HSBC\uc2  analysts said.\par \par \uc2 "The lower-yielding \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  in Asia had suffered at the hands of a hawkish Fed. But this does not necessarily mean they would rebound more now that the Fed is done. The absolute yield differential is still large for most of them," \uc2 HSBC\uc2  added.\par \par \uc2 Market participants now await the \uc2 European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rate decision, due later in the day. (Reporting by Sethuraman NR in Bengaluru; Editing by Varun H K) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2023-7-27T11:28:14.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020230727ej7r01m3q\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
