\par\par \b \uc2 INDIA RUPEE-Rupee weakens to 82/USD before Fed; bullish wagers scaled back\b0\par\par\uc2 326 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 Juli 2023\par 07:26\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2023 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 MUMBAI, July 26 (Reuters) - The Indian rupee declined on Wednesday, amid position adjustments and hedging by importers before the \uc2 U.S. Federal Reserve\uc2 's interest rate decision.\par \par \uc2 The rupee was at 82.00 to the U.S. dollar by 10:50 a.m. IST, down from 81.87 in the previous session. The local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  had opened at 81.8850.\par \par \uc2 The bid on the USD/INR pair following the open is likely from speculators who are trimming short positions and from importers, a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trader at a bank said.\par \par \uc2 "That is to be expected after what happened yesterday."\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2  (RBI) \uc2 likely \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Tuesday when rupee rose to near 81.70, in a repeat of what it has done in the past. The \uc2 RBI\uc2 , for now at least, does not seem inclined to allow rupee to go past that level, according to traders.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's persistent \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  has pushed \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserve back above $600 billion.\par \par \uc2 Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  dropped before a certain Fed rate hike, which investors reckon will likely be the last. A fall in the U.S. inflation rate has fuelled expectations that the Fed had reached the terminal rate.\par \par \uc2 The Fed's last dot plot, however, suggested that another rate hike after July was likely.\par \par \uc2 "The dilemma (at this week's meeting) is whether the Fed hikes 25 bps and sticks with the view that it needs to signal the likely need for one or more rate hikes or whether it moves more to a data dependency stance," \uc2 ING Bank\uc2  said in a note.\par \par \uc2 The rupee forward premiums dropped, with the 1-year implied yield at 1.71%. Premiums had moved higher on Tuesday on likely sell/buy swaps by the \uc2 RBI\uc2  to sterilize the spot \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . (Reporting by Nimesh Vora; Editing by Varun H K) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2023-7-26T06:26:16.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020230726ej7q00hfv\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
