\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 INDIA \highlight\uc2  RUPEE-Rupee snaps 3-day winning run on \uc2 RBI \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 , importer hedging\b0\par\par\uc2 347 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 25 Juli 2023\par 12:23\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2023 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 MUMBAI, July 25 (Reuters) - The Indian rupee snapped a three-day winning streak on Tuesday as the \uc2 Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2  (RBI) \uc2 likely \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  through dollar purchases, while importer hedging further weighed.\par \par \uc2 The rupee ended at 81.8700 against the dollar, compared with 81.8150 at previous close.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 RBI\uc2  likely bought dollars and conducted sell/buy swaps via public sector banks after the rupee reached a more-than-two-month high of 81.6750 in the session, three traders told Reuters.\par \par \uc2 The one-year dollar-rupee implied yield rose four bps to 1.73%, amid the \uc2 RBI\uc2 's possible \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the forwards market.\par \par \uc2 "The rupee's momentum is currently driven by the \uc2 RBI\uc2 ," said Amit Pabari, managing director at CR \b \highlight22\uc2 Forex\b0 \highlight\uc2 . "Even otherwise, factors like robust equity inflows, a weak dollar, and a relatively stronger Chinese yuan currently favour the rupee's appreciation."\par \par \uc2 Foreign investors have bought more than $5 billion of Indian equities so far this month, as per data from the National Securities Depository, supporting the rupee's strength.\par \par \uc2 Besides the dollar inflows, gains in the Chinese yuan have also contributed to the rupee's rise over the past few sessions.\par \par \uc2 The yuan rallied 0.6% to 7.14 against the dollar after the country's top leaders pledged to step up policy support to shore up a flagging economic recovery.\par \par \uc2 Investors are awaiting cues from the \uc2 U.S. Federal Reserve\uc2 's policy decision due late Wednesday where a 25 basis point rate hike is already factored in.\par \par \uc2 Investors will be watching out for commentary on the outlook for further rate increases.\par \par \uc2 An indication from the Fed that this cycle's terminal rate has been likely achieved would be market positive, \uc2 DBS Bank\uc2  said in a note.\par \par \uc2 "The overall signal from the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would be that the next time it makes a move, perhaps in mid-2024, it would be an easing measure," it added. (Reporting by Siddhi Nayak; Editing by Sonia Cheema) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2023-7-25T11:23:33.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020230725ej7p01i0h\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
