\par\par \b \uc2 INDIA RUPEE-Rupee down on Fed policy bets, falls less than peers on likely \uc2 RBI\uc2  help\b0\par\par\uc2 335 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 Februar 2023\par 11:09\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2023 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 MUMBAI, Feb 27 (Reuters) - The Indian rupee declined against the dollar on Monday, as Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  fell on the prospect of the \uc2 U.S. Federal Reserve\uc2  hiking interest rates further and for longer.\par \par \uc2 The rupee finished at 82.8350 per dollar, against its previous close of 82.75.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  weakened up to 82.9475 during the session, its lowest level since Oct. 20, 2022 when the rupee hit a record low.\par \par \uc2 Further declines on Monday were capped by a likely \uc2 Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2  (RBI) \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  via state-run banks, traders said.\par \par \uc2 For comparison, the Philippine peso shed 1.2% and the Malaysian ringgit declined 1% as the dollar index held a seven-week peak after data showed U.S. personal consumption expenditures (PCE) price index rose more than expected in January.\par \par \uc2 The Fed tracks the PCE price indexes for monetary policy.\par \par \uc2 Following the data, investors have fully priced in a 25 basis points Fed rate hike at the next two meetings in March and May and are looking at a possibility of another one in June.\par \par \uc2 "Heading into the week, the rupee could come under pressure if the dollar index continues to gain," wrote \uc2 HDFC Bank\uc2  economists in a note.\par \par \uc2 "The USD/INR pair could also shift to a new range above 83 if the \uc2 RBI\uc2  does not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  actively," they added, expecting the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to defend the upper bound of the new range at anywhere between 83.10 and 83.25 in that case.\par \par \uc2 Markets will keep an eye on U.S. February manufacturing and services prints due on Wednesday and Friday, respectively, to see whether January's strong economic momentum continued.\par \par \uc2 Additionally, India's December-quarter economic growth data will be released after market on Tuesday, which is likely to show growth slowed amid weakening demand, a Reuters poll said.\par \par \uc2 (Reporting by Anushka Trivedi; Editing by Janane Venkatraman) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2023-2-27T11:09:34.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020230227ej2r01qch\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
