\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 INDIA \highlight\uc2  RUPEE-Rupee ends week lower on likely \uc2 RBI \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 , importer hedging\b0\par\par\uc2 328 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 Januar 2023\par 11:09\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2023 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 MUMBAI, Jan 27 (Reuters) - The Indian rupee rose marginally against the dollar on Friday, but ended the week lower due to suspected \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The rupee inched up to 81.5225 to the dollar from 811.59 in the previous session. For the week, the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was down 0.5%.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  came under pressure after it managed to climb above the 81 level on Monday thanks to dollar purchases from public sector banks, likely on the directions of the \uc2 Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 RBI\uc2 's suspected \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  prompted short speculative dollar positions to exit and importers to step up hedges for near maturities, a trader at a private sector bank said.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 RBI\uc2 's dollar purchases "were not a big surprise" and were consistent with what the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been doing over the last several weeks, the trader added.\par \par \uc2 For the dollar, it was a relatively quiet week against its major peers. The dollar index was only marginally lower week-on-week, with the \uc2 U.S. Federal Reserve\uc2  policy review lined up for next week.\par \par \uc2 The Fed is widely expected to opt for a 25-basis-point rate hike on Feb 1. The key will be what Fed officials say on the future path, especially with investors pricing in rate cuts for later this year.\par \par \uc2 On the same day, India will present its federal budget.\par \par \uc2 "Markets are possibly a little cautious ahead of the budget on the lack of (dollar) inflows and (India's) high current account deficit is an ongoing concern," said Jayaram Krishnamurthy, head of research and advisory at Almus Risk Consulting.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the impact of the decline in Indian equities due to the \uc2 Adani Group\uc2 -led selloff was fairly limited. Indian equities have dropped 2.7% in the last two days. (Reporting by Nimesh Vora; Editing by Savio D'Souza) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2023-1-27T11:09:20.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020230127ej1r017r2\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
