\par\par \b \uc2 INDIA RUPEE-Rupee ends down; 83.00-83.50/USD likely lowest level this year - analyst\b0\par\par\uc2 352 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 25 Oktober 2022\par 12:06\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2022 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 MUMBAI, Oct 25 (Reuters) - The Indian rupee ended slightly lower versus the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Tuesday, weighed down by dollar demand from importers amid lower than usual volumes.\par \par \uc2 The rupee closed at 82.7250 per U.S. dollar compared with 82.6750 in the previous session, while daily volume was lower than on most days, according to traders.\par \par \uc2 A trader at a private sector bank said it was a "dull" session, marked by some dollar demand from importers, while speculators were "mostly" on the dollar offer side.\par \par \uc2 The local unit moved in about 16 paisa trading range on Tuesday after last week's volatility.\par \par \uc2 The rupee had hit a record low of 83.29 to the dollar last week, before \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \uc2 Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2  helped it recover.\par \par \uc2 A few analysts now believe the rupee is unlikely to fall significantly below its record low, at least for the rest of 2022.\par \par \uc2 The rupee is likely to "find its ground" between 83 and 83.50 to the dollar, Arnob Biswas, head \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  research at \uc2 SMC Global Securities\uc2 , said.\par \par \uc2 Elaborating on the assessment about rupee having seen its worst for the year, Biswas said there is a "sense that (U.S.) Fed may slow down the (rate) hike cycle" and that the dollar index is likely to be weaker over the next two months, possibly falling to below 109.\par \par \uc2 The U.S. dollar index was little changed at around 112, having come under pressure amid bets that Fed officials may slow down the pace of rate increases soon.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the focus in the Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  space was firmly on the Chinese yuan.\par \par \uc2 The yuan traded outside of China dropped to a record low of 7.3650 per dollar following a weaker-than-expected daily fix from the country's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Other Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  followed the yuan lower.\par \par \uc2 Indian financial markets will be closed on Wednesday for a local holiday. (Reporting by Nimesh Vora; Editing by Neha Arora) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2022-10-25T11:06:43.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020221025eiap01zj1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
