\par\par \b \uc2 EMERGING MARKETS-Recession woes, soaring dollar pummel EM  \highlight22\uc2 currencies \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 559 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 September 2022\par 11:04\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2022 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 EM \b \highlight22\uc2 Currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  at their lowest level since May 2020\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 China's onshore yuan hits lowest since global financial crisis\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 India's inclusion in \uc2 JP Morgan\uc2 's EM debt index delayed - sources\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 EBRD\uc2  hikes Turkey's growth view to 4.5% for 2022\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Russian stocks extend recovery, rouble eases\par \par \uc2 By Bansari Mayur Kamdar\par \par \uc2 Sept 28 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  of emerging economies dropped to their lowest level in nearly 28 months on Wednesday, as fears of a more aggressive \uc2 U.S. Federal Reserve\uc2  and a global economic slowdown sent investors into the arms of the safe-haven dollar.\par \par \uc2 The MSCI's index for emerging market \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  fell 0.9% at 0847 GMT as the dollar hit a fresh two-decade peak against a basket of \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "It's another day of souring risk sentiment and we see that being reflected in the EM \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , partly driven lower by a rise in the U.S. long-term yields... The markets are clearly worried that the U.S. will go into a recession and with that the global economy," said Per Hammarlund, Chief EM Strategist at SEB.\par \par \uc2 "The only thing that could change this is that we are potentially seeing signs that the dollar might be peaking and then we could have a bit of a temporary recovery in EM \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 ."\par \par \uc2 China's onshore yuan fell to its weakest level since the global financial crisis of 2008, while the offshore trades hit a record low, even as \uc2 China's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  announced fresh steps this week making it more expensive to bet against the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 A source also told Reuters on Tuesday that Chinese monetary authorities were asking local banks to revive a yuan fixing tool as they seek to steer and defend the rapidly weakening \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Stocks in Shanghai declined 1.6%, while equities in the broader emerging market shed 2.0%.\par \par \uc2 Russian stocks extended their recovery amid volatile trading sparked by President \uc2 Vladimir Putin\uc2 's mobilisation order, while the rouble eased against the dollar.\par \par \uc2 The Turkish lira was down 0.2% after hitting a record low in the previous session.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 European Bank for Reconstruction and Development\uc2  (\uc2 EBRD\uc2 ) said Turkey's economy was expected to grow at a 4.5% rate this year, raising its 2.0% forecast of six months ago in a nod to robust consumption in the face of inflation.\par \par \uc2 South Africa's rand shed 0.8% against the dollar.\par \par \uc2 Central and Eastern European \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  were mixed against the euro, with the Hungarian forint declining 1% a day after its massive 125 basis point hike.\par \par \uc2 The Indian rupee was rooted at all-time lows, with traders suspecting that \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \uc2 Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2  was keeping the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  from weakening further.\par \par \uc2 India's long wait to win inclusion in \uc2 JPMorgan\uc2 's emerging market debt index was set to be pushed out into next year due to a number of issues New Delhi needed to address, sources said. For GRAPHIC on emerging market \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  performance in 2022, see {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://tmsnrt.rs/2egbfVh"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 here}}}\uc2  For GRAPHIC on MSCI emerging index performance in 2022, see {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://tmsnrt.rs/2OusNdX"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 here}}}\par \par \uc2 For TOP NEWS across emerging markets\par \par \uc2 For CENTRAL EUROPE market report, see\par \par \uc2 For TURKISH market report, see\par \par \uc2 For RUSSIAN market report, see (Reporting by Bansari Mayur Kamdar in Bengaluru; Editing by Alex Richardson) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2022-9-28T10:04:31.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020220928ei9s01jv8\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
